{"method":{"methodHash":"4391e436f2c4e38d93b67b584b654c0c","typeHash":"32dcfd1d62834e6a7a2852258e01a2ac","name":"GetSPX","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/AILogic/PredictionManager.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":262,"startColumn":9,"endLine":277,"endColumn":10},"calls":[{"span":{"startLine":273,"startColumn":34,"endLine":273,"endColumn":61},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Average"}]},"lines":["        public static int GetSPX()","        {","            if (!_initialized || _velocityXHistory.Count == 0)","            {","                return _prevX;","            }","","            // Get lead multiplier from settings","            double leadMultiplier = AimSettings.ShalloeLeadMultiplier;","","            // Calculate average velocity","            double avgVelocity = _velocityXHistory.Average();","","            // Predict future position: current \u002B (average velocity * lead multiplier)","            return (int)(_prevX \u002B avgVelocity * leadMultiplier);","        }"],"startLine":262}